动态STC机制中用于评估条件(14)的函数K的完整表达式为：

K = \frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n} \sum_{j=1}^{n} \left( \frac{1}{\alpha_{i,j}} \right) \left( \frac{1}{\beta_{i,j}} \right) \left( \frac{1}{\gamma_{i,j}} \right) \left( \frac{1}{\delta_{i,j}} \right)}{\sum_{i=1}^{n} \sum_{j=1}^{n} \left( \frac{1}{\alpha_{i,j}} \right) \left( \frac{1}{\beta_{i,j}} \right) \left( \frac{1}{\gamma_{i,j}} \right) \left( \frac{1}{\delta_{i,j}} \right)}

其中，\alpha_{i,j}, \beta_{i,j}, \gamma_{i,j}, \delta_{i,j} 是与第i个智能体、第j个智能体相关的参数。该函数用于衡量条件(14)的满足程度，其值介于0和1之间。
